# Corrections applied on top of the transcription. src/people.psv, orgs.psv, places.psv
# and timeline.psv are re-transcribed straight from the workbook and are not edited by
# hand; everything we change to the source's own values goes here instead, so the two stay
# separable. Each correction is written into the record's data flag as well, so a reader
# of the page sees it.
# id|field|value|why
#
# --- names the source leaves incomplete or misspelled -------------------------
200045|name|Alfred Waterhouse|First name missing in the source. He is the architect of the town hall the record itself names.
200035|name|Friedrich Engels|First name missing in the source.
200049|name|James McConnel|First name missing in the source. Of the Ancoats firm McConnel & Kennedy - check before relying on it.
200050|name|John Kennedy|First name missing in the source. Of the Ancoats firm McConnel & Kennedy - check before relying on it.
200005|name|Granville Sharp|The source spells it Sharpe.
200064|name|Charlotte Brontë|The source drops the diacritic.
200059|name|William Fairbairn|The source spells it Fairburn. He is the engineer, father of Thomas Fairbairn.
200004|name|Unnamed founder, Society for the Abolition of Slavery|The source names this record only "Founder?" and puts the society in its notes.
#
# --- the Philips family -------------------------------------------------------
200033|name|Mark Philips|The family and the MP spell it Philips; the source has Phillips on this row alone.
PL-BASE-014|name|Philips Park|Named for Mark Philips, and spelled Philips. The source has Phillips.
#
# --- boroughs -----------------------------------------------------------------
PL-BASE-006|area|Manchester|The Portico Library is on Mosley Street in Manchester. The source files it under Salford.
PL-BASE-013|area|Salford|Peel Park is in Salford. The source files it under Manchester.
PL-BASE-020|area|Salford|Salford Museum and Art Gallery. The source files it under Manchester.
PL-BASE-024|area|Salford|Weaste Cemetery is in Salford. The source files it under Manchester.
PL-BASE-039|area|Salford|Salford Lads Club. The source files it under Manchester.
PL-BASE-056|area|Manchester|The Castlefield warehouses are in Manchester. The source files them under Salford.
