PL-BASE-039|connectedPeople||Cleared: the cell held relevance text, not people.
PL-BASE-045|relevance|Manchester's first cotton mill was built in the early 1780s; by 1830 there were 99 cotton-spinning mills.|The source leaves the relevance column empty and puts this text in Connected people.
PL-BASE-045|connectedPeople||Cleared: the cell held relevance text, not people.
PL-BASE-043|connectedPeople||Cleared: the cell repeats the relevance text, garbled to "0H)istorically male institution".
